## Current AI default — 16 September 2026

New battles use candidate90 cognition by default on the normal battlefield. Launch
`scripts/launch.sh` normally; `-ArmyTrenches` selects Trenches. `-ArmyLegacy` selects
the legacy AI. The CLI defaults to cognition; use `--legacy-ai`, `--foundations`, or
`--recovery` for historical controllers. Explicit `--cognition` still works.
`tools/rerun_battle.py` reads the recorded controller and exact duration, including
legacy manifests without a cognition field. Simulation `Config{}` intentionally
retains legacy defaults for historical library callers and regression fixtures.

Candidate90 supports encounters 0–43. Later research encounters 44–59 and their
contracts belong to the [candidate141 archive](../experiments/candidate141/README.md).
The [main-build report](AI_MAIN_BUILD.md) supersedes older opt-in status notes below.
